---
// src/pages/disclaimer.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Legal Disclaimer & Non-Affiliation Declaration — NIRNAY MP"
  description="Official non-government declaration for NIRNAY. Independent public advisory and deterministic Madhya Pradesh job eligibility engine."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="bg-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 border border-border shadow-sm">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 border border-amber-200 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Statutory Declaration
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-foreground mb-6">
        Legal Disclaimer & Independent Status
      </h1>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm text-muted-foreground space-y-6 leading-relaxed">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 text-amber-950 font-medium">
          <strong>Non-Government Entity:</strong> NIRNAY (nirnay.in) is an independently operated educational and career discovery platform. NIRNAY is NOT associated, affiliated, endorsed, or sponsored by the Government of Madhya Pradesh, the Government of India, or any statutory recruitment authority (including MPESB, MPPSC, High Court of MP, or Vyapam).
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground pt-4">
          1. Purpose of the Platform
        </h2>
        <p>
          The sole objective of NIRNAY is to assist Indian citizens in understanding and evaluating official government recruitment notifications through deterministic, rule-based algorithms. All eligibility rules, age cutoffs, category relaxations, vacancy breakdowns, and dates are synthesized directly from public gazettes and rulebooks published by official recruitment agencies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground pt-4">
          2. Mandatory User Verification
        </h2>
        <p>
          While NIRNAY implements strict 6-stage data verification before publishing any record, recruitment notices remain subject to addenda, corrigenda, postponements, cancellations, or revisions by official authorities at any time. 
          <strong>Users are strictly advised to review the official notification PDF and verify all criteria on official government websites prior to submitting any application form or fee.</strong>
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground pt-4">
          3. Direct Official Portals Directory
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-foreground">
          <li><strong>Madhya Pradesh Employees Selection Board (MPESB):</strong> <a href="https://esb.mp.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://esb.mp.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC):</strong> <a href="https://mppsc.mp.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://mppsc.mp.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>High Court of Madhya Pradesh (MPHC):</strong> <a href="https://mphc.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://mphc.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>MP Online Application Portal:</strong> <a href="https://mponline.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://mponline.gov.in</a></li>
          <li><strong>MP Employment Exchange Portal (Rojgar Panjiyan):</strong> <a href="https://mprojgar.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://mprojgar.gov.in</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground pt-4">
          4. Zero Financial Transactions
        </h2>
        <p>
          NIRNAY does not charge any application fee, registration fee, commission, or brokerage from candidates. We never collect payment card information. All fee payments are conducted strictly on official government portals (such as MPOnline).
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
